        "original_id": "e3a8b243-4227-536c-875a-1d0686d0ea83",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tyler Bunch, Jerry Nelson, Peter Linz\n- Characters: Herry Monster\n- TV shows: Person of Interest, The Blacklist\n- Video games: Red Dead Redemption, Grand Theft Auto V, Red Dead Revolver, Mafia III\n- Companies: Rockstar San Diego, Rockstar Games\n- Topics: Off-Broadway productions, American television appearances\n\nFacts:\n- Tyler Bunch has acted in a few Off-Broadway productions.\n- Tyler Bunch has appeared on American television shows including Person of Interest and The Blacklist.\n- Tyler Bunch has appeared in video games including Grand Theft Auto V, Red Dead Redemption, Mafia III, and Red Dead Revolver.\n- From 1970 to 2003, Jerry Nelson performed Herry Monster on Sesame Street.\n- In 2013, Tyler Bunch performed Herry Monster on Sesame Street.\n- Red Dead Redemption is a Western action-adventure video game developed by Rockstar San Diego and published by Rockstar Games.\n- Since 2017, Peter Linz has performed Herry Monster on Sesame Street.",
